---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: 회사연혁
eyebrow: About Us
lead: 트라이얼정보통신이 걸어온 주요 발자취입니다.
section: about
description: (주)트라이얼정보통신의 주요 연혁입니다.
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="timeline">
      {%- for era in company.history %}
      <div class="timeline__era reveal">
        <p class="timeline__year">{{ era.year }}</p>
        <div class="timeline__items">
          {%- for item in era.items %}
          <div class="timeline__item">
            {%- if item.date %}<p class="timeline__date">{{ item.date }}</p>{% endif %}
            <p class="timeline__text">{{ item.text }}</p>
          </div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
